    {
      "turn": 1,
      "doctor_question": "Hello, I'm Dr. Smith. It's nice to meet you; could you tell me what brings you in to see me today?",
      "targeted_symptom": "S003",
      "patient_response": "Nice to meet you, Dr. Smith. Well, I guess what really brought me in is... well, my wife, mostly. She'll be standing there telling me about my cousin’s appointments, or, you know, coordinating his rides. Which is a whole ordeal because he lives out past the old highway, and they’ve been doing all that construction out there for months. I swear they just leave the orange cones up even when nobody's working, it backs up traffic for miles and for what? But anyway, she'll be talking about his schedule, and I’m looking right at her, making eye contact and everything, but... a minute later I realize I didn’t actually take in half of what she just said.",
